    forensicSummary: 'Sui has meaningful use and a differentiated object model, but deep capital and token drawdowns plus four 2026 liveness incidents keep it middling.', forensicWhy: 'A novel Move stack and vertical ecosystem support created a coherent product, while switching costs, Foundation dependence and production maturity limited durable capital and reliability.',
