    forensicSummary: 'Near is a live but capital-light L1 whose chain-abstraction strategy creates meaningful tracked flow without yet proving durable native liquidity or token capture.', forensicWhy: 'Sharding and usability differentiated the original chain; Intents and Chain Signatures expanded distribution while making attribution, operator risk and value capture harder to assess.',
